                                "sense_id": "6b53d0a2-7ffb-3a4d-a464-55107b60c278",
                                "text": "For the first adjustment [to a door that keeps swinging open], you might need to remove the screws from the frame, move the hinge slightly, and then make new screw holes with a bradawl and reinsert the screws."
